{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>10噸級電動商用飛機CE-25A近日在山東濱州完成首次有人駕駛智能飛行，機翼兩側裝載中國科學院電工研究所自研的10台分佈式電涵道推進電機系統，系統總功率2MW，為該型全球最大載人純電動客機提供全部動力。</strong>CE-25A由中國商飛研製，是其首款電動商用飛機，主要面向城際商業飛行場景。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587054.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.570872+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_hash":"2e92ec4d2c032dfdb81702a4be20bf38a1155e4910a4084270fa31327195553f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}